# Build context for gateway/Dockerfile. docker-compose.yml builds the gateway from platform/
# (not gateway/) so the image can copy worker/tenant_keys.py, the per-tenant key derivation both
# services share. Only what that image needs is sent to the daemon; .env, data/ and everything
# else never are. The worker and embeddings images build from their own directories, which this
# file does not cover.
*
!gateway
!worker/__init__.py
!worker/tenant_keys.py
**/__pycache__
